    "# 1-Year Lifetime Value (LTV) Prediction for Digital Neobanks\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates a production-style **1-Year LTV** prediction pipeline for a digital neobank.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Design choices:**\n",
    "- Scoring window philosophy: KYC + **30 days**\n",
    "- Target: **1-Year** Lifetime Value\n",
    "- Model: **LightGBM** with **Tweedie** objective (variance power 1.5)\n",
    "- Dataset: public [FinTech Customer Life Time Value (LTV) Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/harunrai/fintech-customer-life-time-value-ltv-dataset)\n",
    "\n",
    "> The public dataset has very strong relationships between spend and LTV. Real-world production metrics are typically lower (Spearman ~0.65–0.75, MdAPE 7–15%). The architecture and feature approach remain the same."
   ]
  }
